      "title": "can: Optimized column info for better readability",
      "message": "can: Optimized column info for better readability\n\nColumn info is tuned for better readability. It containes CAN ID and Length.\nThe same applies to protocol item within protocol tree.\n\nEntire packet data (payload) should not be printed to column info by default.\nSo this behaviour is removed.\n",
      "author_name": "Developer Alexander",
      "author_email": "dev@alex-mails.de",
      "authored_date": "2021-07-15T13:41:53.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
